<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>You missed an assignment deadline</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; background: #f6f8fa; }
    .card { background: #ffffff; padding: 28px 32px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
    .header { color: #c0392b; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 12px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .header h2 { margin: 0; }
    .meta { background: #fdecea; padding: 16px 18px; border-left: 4px solid #c0392b; border-radius: 4px; margin: 18px 0; font-size: 14px; }
    .meta div { margin: 4px 0; }
    .meta strong { color: #111; }
    .footer { margin-top: 24px; font-size: 12px; color: #777; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 12px; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="header">
      <h2>Deadline missed: {{assignmentTitle}}</h2>
    </div>

    <p>Hi {{firstName}},</p>
    <p>The deadline for your assignment <strong>{{assignmentTitle}}</strong> has passed and we did not receive a submission from you.</p>

    <div class="meta">
      <div><strong>Due by:</strong> {{endDate}}</div>
      <div><strong>Status:</strong> Missed</div>
    </div>

    <p>Your manager and admin have been notified. If you believe this was a mistake or you'd like an extension, please reach out to your manager or contact <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a>.</p>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; {{year}} {{appName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
